# Shell scripts must stay LF in the repo and on checkout, regardless of the
# committer's platform or core.autocrlf setting. The SUT deploy.sh / workload
# scripts are the reviewer entry points (REPRODUCE.md, evaluation/suts/*/) and
# a stray CRLF breaks the shebang on Linux/macOS ("/usr/bin/env: 'bash\r'").
*.sh   text eol=lf
*.bash text eol=lf
